lede="Take-Two has already killed the biggest GTA 6 PC port project. On November 24, GitHub disabled Leonida and all 3,007 repositories in its fork network after a DMCA notice from Take-Two's IP enforcement team. The question now is whether VIctory, XCL and the dozens of forks chasing them are next. Take-Two's own history says yes, and the projects are already reacting: some have gone private, one removed the game's name from its code, and another stopped answering on GitHub with no explanation.",
